<Legal title="Privacy Policy" path="/privacy">
  <p>
    IV Salt Rejuvenation ("we," "us," or "our") respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains what
    information we collect through our website and services, how we use it, and the choices you have.
  </p>

  <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
  <p>When you book an appointment or contact us, we may collect:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Contact details</strong> — your name, phone number, and email address.</li>
    <li><strong>Service address</strong> — the physical address where you request treatment.</li>
    <li><strong>Booking details</strong> — the therapy and add-ons you select, and your preferred date and time.</li>
    <li><strong>Health information</strong> — any information you provide through our consent and medical
      screening forms (handled under our <a href="/hipaa">HIPAA Notice</a>).</li>
    <li><strong>Technical data</strong> — basic analytics such as pages visited and device type (see our <a href="/cookies">Cookie Policy</a>).</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To schedule, confirm, and provide your mobile IV therapy appointments.</li>
    <li>To contact you about your booking, including confirmations and reminders by email, text, or phone.</li>
    <li>To process your deposit and payments through our third-party providers.</li>
    <li>To improve our website and services and to comply with legal obligations.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How We Share Information</h2>
  <p>We do not sell your personal information. We share it only with:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Service providers</strong> that help us operate — for example, scheduling, calendar,
      email/SMS delivery, and payment processors — who are bound to protect your information.</li>
    <li><strong>Our care team</strong> (registered nurse and supervising medical director) to deliver treatment.</li>
    <li><strong>Authorities</strong> when required by law.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Text Messages</h2>
  <p>
    By providing your phone number and booking with us, you consent to receive appointment-related calls and
    text messages. Message and data rates may apply. You can opt out of texts at any time by replying STOP.
  </p>

  <h2>Data Retention & Security</h2>
  <p>
    We keep your information only as long as needed to provide services and meet legal and medical
    record-keeping requirements. We use reasonable administrative and technical safeguards to protect it.
  </p>

  <h2>Your Choices</h2>
  <p>
    You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal information, subject to legal and
    medical record requirements. Contact us using the details below.
  </p>

  <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
  <p>Our website and services are not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their information.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The "last updated" date above reflects the latest revision.</p>
</Legal>
